    "After installation, you can run \"abtp\" in your terminal to list all devices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une fois l'outil installé, la commande « abtp » affiche tous les appareils dans le Terminal."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装此工具后, 在命令行中执行\"abtp\"即可列出所有设备."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安裝此工具後, 在命令列中執行\"abtp\"即可列出所有裝置."
          }
        }
      }
    },
