          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If some of your devices shows battery level in the Bluetooth menu, but AirBattery Plus doesn't find it. Try disconnecting and reconnecting it, and wait a few minutes.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si un appareil affiche sa batterie dans le menu Bluetooth mais qu'AirBattery Plus ne le trouve pas, déconnectez-le, reconnectez-le et patientez quelques minutes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果某些设备在系统蓝牙菜单中有电量显示\n但是在 AirBattery Plus 中没有显示出来的话\n请尝试断开然后重新连接它们并等待几分钟"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果某些裝置在系統藍芽選單中有電量顯示\n但是在 AirBattery Plus 中沒有顯示出來的話\n請嘗試斷開然後重新連線它們並等待幾分鐘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the difference in battery usage between the left and right earbuds is less than this value, AirBattery Plus will show them as one device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si l'écart de batterie entre les écouteurs gauche et droit est inférieur à cette valeur, AirBattery Plus les affiche comme un seul appareil."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若一副立体声耳机的左右两侧的电量差距小于此值, AirBattery Plus 会将它们合并显示为一个设备."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若一副立體聲耳機的左右兩側的電量差距小於此值, AirBattery Plus 會將它們合併顯示為一個裝置."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you see a bluetooth pairing request from any device that isn't yours, add it to your blocklist!": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si un appareil qui n'est pas à vous demande un jumelage Bluetooth, ajoutez-le à la liste de blocage !"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果您看到任何来自不属于您的设备的蓝牙配对请求, 将其加入屏蔽列表就能让它消失."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果您看到任何來自不屬於您的裝置的藍芽配對請求, 將其加入遮蔽列表就能讓它消失."
          }
        }
      }
    },
