    "Try to get the battery usage of any Bluetooth device that AirBattery Plus can find\n\nWARNING: This is a BETA feature and may cause unexpected errors!": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tente de lire la batterie de tout appareil Bluetooth qu'AirBattery Plus peut trouver\n\nATTENTION : fonction en bêta, qui peut provoquer des erreurs inattendues !"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尝试扫描周边所有的 BLE 设备, 即使它可能不属于您\n\n请注意: 这是一项测试版功能, 可能会导致未知的错误!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
